<title>UKRAINE: SOCCER-UKRAINE 2 N.IRELAND 1 WORLD CUP QUALIFIER - RESULT.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-UKRAINE 2 N.IRELAND 1 WORLD CUP QUALIFIER - RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>KIEV 1997-04-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ukraine beat Northern Ireland 2-1 (halftime 1-1) in their World Cup European group nine qualifier on Wednesday:</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Ukraine - Vitaliy Kosovsky 3, Andriy Shevchenko 71</p>
<p>Northern Ireland - Iain Dowie 15 pen</p>
<p>Attendance: 75,000</p>
